# Sales Data Analysis Project

## Project Overview
This project analyses sales data to understand business performance and identify opportunities to improve sales.

## Objectives
- Analyse total sales and revenue.
- Identify top-selling products.
- Compare sales across customers.
- Track monthly sales performance.
- Generate insights to support business decisions.

## Tools Used
- Microsoft Excel
- SQL
- Power BI

## Key Business Questions
1. What are the total sales?
2. Which products generate the most revenue?
3. Which customers contribute the most sales?
4. Which months have the highest sales?

## Project Status
In progress — sample data, SQL analysis, and a Power BI dashboard will be added.

